          "en-US": "Read-only ROS 2 and DDS inspection on Android"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Read-only Android ROS 2/DDS inspector. Run camera and LiDAR together on the Dashboard with independent topics. Includes four numeric telemetry watches, saved profile layouts, chart scales and legend, compact previews, offline indexed URDF meshes, and passive OccupancyGrid/TF localization. No commands, parameters or service calls. ARM64, Android 9 or newer. Independent upstream repository; not the official f-droid.org catalogue."
